algorithms.pseudocode:
function SELECT-STEEPNESS(coeffs, eps, margin):
  require eps > 0
  S <- sum of |c_i| over coeffs        # ell-1 mass of output weights
  if S == 0:
    return 1.0                         # network is identically zero
  return (1 + margin) * S * log(2) / eps   # strict-inequality safety margin
